* ident_call2 -- counts to N, testing IDENT(A, A) once per step (the 2-arg predicate).
* bottleneck: one 2-arg IDENT() call per iteration (s199 slice 2/3 inline measurement).
* Standalone:  scrip ident_call2.sno   |   sbl -bf ident_call2.sno   |   snobol4 ident_call2.sno
        &TRIM = 1
        &ANCHOR = 0
        &STLIMIT = -1
        DEFINE('IDENT_CALL2(N)')                        :(IDENT_CALL2_END)
IDENT_CALL2  A = 0
        ZI = 1
ZBL     A = A + 1
        IDENT(A, A)
        ZI = LT(ZI, N) ZI + 1                           :S(ZBL)
        IDENT_CALL2 = A                                 :(RETURN)
IDENT_CALL2_END
*BENCH kernel=IDENT_CALL2 check=1000 bud=500 flr=20
        OUTPUT = 'ident_call2(1000) = ' IDENT_CALL2(1000)
END
